{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41934","headline":"晚春客次偶吟 · 李中","name":"晚春客次偶吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂驻征轮野店间，悠悠时节又春残。\n落花风急宿酲解，芳草雨昏春梦寒。\n慙逐利名头易白，欲眠云水志犹难。\n却怜村寺僧相引，闲上虚楼共倚栏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}